    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Just like the name says, &quot;Cooperate with Yourself&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use 18 different keys to control up to six characters simultaneously and reach the goal.<br>You'll face a variety of tricky obstacles that can't be overcome without perfect cooperation.<br>Clear all 16 levels and make it to the ending!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D platformer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A co-op experience in single-player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully customizable key bindings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time trial mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable screen aspect ratio</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Just like the name says, &quot;Cooperate with Yourself&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use 18 different keys to control up to six characters simultaneously and reach the goal.<br>You'll face a variety of tricky obstacles that can't be overcome without perfect cooperation.<br>Clear all 16 levels and make it to the ending!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D platformer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A co-op experience in single-player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully customizable key bindings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time trial mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable screen aspect ratio</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "This game is a 2D platformer where a single player controls up to six characters. In other words, it's a game that lets you experience a multiplayer co-op game all by yourself. Work together, use each other as stepping stones when needed, and clear all 16 levels!",
